 target. I will send cav-1 to F1, aiming for the standard, while inf-1 holds F1."},{"seq":932,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c326","house":"rhino","letter":"L390","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1","s-west"],"depart":5700,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":933,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c327","house":"rhino","letter":"L391","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":5700,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":934,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1711,"retries":0},{"seq":935,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Tiger pressure at F3 (East Ford). My doctrine is to hold East Ford (F3) with Ele/Inf and Archers on North Bank. I need to reinforce F3 and counter Tiger's presence there. I will use my existing units to secure F3 and send a double cipher to reinforce the doctrine."},{"seq":936,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c328","house":"kite","letter":"L392","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":937,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c329","house":"kite","letter":"L392","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-ferry","n-east"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":938,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c330","house":"kite","letter":"L393","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":939,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c331","house":"kite","letter":"L393","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-ferry","n-east"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":940,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1669,"retries":0},{"seq":941,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Doctrine suggests early peace, but rhino/tiger truces are active. I will try to leverage the existing truces and aim for F2, the middle ford. I'll move forces towards F2 and send a cipher letter to Kite to initiate peace."},{"seq":942,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c332","house":"orchid","letter":"L394","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":943,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c333","house":"orchid","letter":"L395","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2","n-mid"],"depart":6000,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, IBQOD TK IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":944,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c334","house":"orchid","letter":"L396","kind":"letter","to":"kite-camp","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2","n-mid","north-village","kite-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":"TQUOM"},{"seq":945,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1698,"retries":0},{"seq":946,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is Watch 20. My doctrine is to mass on the east ford late. I have strong units at F3 (East Ford). Kite has units near F3. I will reinforce F3 and use my archers to suppress any incoming riders, adhering to the doctrine of late massing."},{"seq":947,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c335","house":"tiger","letter":"L397","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":"OPRKJI EKKQ, HSNRB QK PSOQ EKNI."},{"seq":948,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c336","house":"tiger","letter":"L398","kind":"order","to":"tiger-arch-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":600